,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":6612.154434777,"data":"    1. Train a detection model for 10 epochs with an initial learning_rate of 0.01\r\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":6612.15445457,"data":"        yolo train data=coco8.yaml model=yolo11n.pt epochs=10 lr0=0.01\r\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":6612.154461932,"data":"\r\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":6612.154466265,"data":"    2. Predict a YouTube video using a pretrained segmentation model at image size 320:\r\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":6612.154470423,"data":"        yolo predict model=yolo11n-seg.pt source='https://youtu.be/LNwODJXcvt4' imgsz=320\r\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":6612.154474062,"data":"\r\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":6612.1544773,"data":"    3. Val a pretrained detection model at batch-size 1 and image size 640:\r\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":6612.154481052,"data":"        yolo val model=yolo11n.pt data=coco8.yaml batch=1 imgsz=640\r\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":6612.15448455,"data":"\r\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":6612.154488216,"data":"    4. Export a YOLO11n classification model to ONNX format at image size 224 by 128 (no TASK required)\r\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":6612.154491983,"data":"        yolo export model=yolo11n-cls.pt format=onnx imgsz=224,128\r\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":6612.154495729,"data":"\r\n"}
